[
  {
    "id": "narrator_start_1",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": false,
    "caption": "This is the story of Pidge. A small pigeon, in a very big kitchen, with places to be.",
    "file": "narrator_start_1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_start_2",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": false,
    "caption": "Every legend begins somewhere. Pidge's began beside a pot of soup… and a very angry chef.",
    "file": "narrator_start_2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_start_3",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": false,
    "caption": "Pidge looked up. Somewhere above the cabinets, the sky was waiting.",
    "file": "narrator_start_3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_start_4",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": false,
    "caption": "And so, once again, Pidge chose violence. Against gravity, specifically.",
    "file": "narrator_start_4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_start_5",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": false,
    "caption": "The chef had plans for Pidge. Pidge had wings. Only one of them was getting their way.",
    "file": "narrator_start_5.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_loop_1",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": true,
    "caption": "And just like that, Pidge was back in the kitchen. Some say this is how all legends work.",
    "file": "narrator_loop_1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_loop_2",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": true,
    "caption": "Heaven, it turns out, has a back door. It opens directly above the soup.",
    "file": "narrator_loop_2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_loop_3",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "kitchen",
    "loop": true,
    "caption": "The circle of life. Or, as Pidge would come to call it… the circle of pots.",
    "file": "narrator_loop_3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_dessert_1",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "dessert",
    "caption": "The kitchen fell away. Ahead lay the Dessert. Hot sand, hard rocks, and absolutely no cake.",
    "file": "narrator_dessert_1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_dessert_2",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "dessert",
    "caption": "Someone had misspelled desert on the map. Pidge did not find this funny. The cacti did.",
    "file": "narrator_dessert_2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_dessert_3",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "dessert",
    "caption": "Out the window and into the wild. The chef's shouting faded. The cacti began to whisper.",
    "file": "narrator_dessert_3.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_dessert_4",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "dessert",
    "caption": "Pidge burst into open sky, and the sun said hello. Loudly.",
    "file": "narrator_dessert_4.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_heaven_1",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "heaven",
    "caption": "And then… the clouds parted. Bird Heaven. A golden halo, and not a single cat.",
    "file": "narrator_heaven_1.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_heaven_2",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "heaven",
    "caption": "Pidge had made it. For one moment, there was nothing to dodge. Just sky.",
    "file": "narrator_heaven_2.mp3"
  },
  {
    "id": "narrator_heaven_3",
    "persona": "narrator",
    "event": "level_start",
    "level": "heaven",
    "caption": "Bird Heaven. Where the breadcrumbs are free, and the wind only ever blows upward.",
    "file": "narrator_heaven_3.mp3"
  },
  {
